WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:01.787
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>What</b> are you <b>doing</b>?

00:00:05.485 --> 00:00:06.810
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m <b>making dinner</b>.

00:00:10.518 --> 00:00:12.457
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are the <b>children doing</b> their <b>homework</b>?

00:00:16.127 --> 00:00:17.433
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>No</b>, they <b>aren’t</b>.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.567
They’re <b>watching TV</b>.

00:00:26.217 --> 00:00:27.677
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>What’s</b> your <b>mother doing</b>?

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:32.546
<v><b>B:</b></v> She’s <b>helping</b> me.